{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/802182-chambers-real-world-enviromental-change","id":802182,"title":"Chambers & real world enviromental change","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Beast: The Primordial"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-01-06T09:51:30-08:00","id":802182,"title":"Chambers & real world enviromental change","content":"Your are playing Makara with Lair traits Poor light and Suffocating. You create a new chamber in an abandoned school, since the lights are not working there, anymore. Following questions:<br /> 1.) Can you reshape / redesign the chamber to an underwater abandoned hotel?<br /> 2.) You created the Chamber during summer (30 Celsius). How does the Chamber look during winter? Is it cold there? You have no lair traits that can change temperature.<br /> 3.) Is there a possibility how to watch TV / have internet signal in a Chamber?<br /> 4.) What happens when a developer in real world tears down the old school and builds a shopping mall? Can you still use the Chamber? Does the Chamber change to a shopping mall?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10749-skydiver","name":"skydiver","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"25"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-06T12:39:49-08:00","id":802274,"title":"","content":"The chamber reflects the real world location as it was when the chamber was created. Any subsequent changes to said location aren't reflected in the chamber, though they might make it hard to open a primordial pathway.<br /> <br /> I don't know how you would get internet or cable tv in the Lair, since those things require a connection to networks that don't exist in the primordial dream. That said, you could pretty easily bring in a computer or a television as long as you had a generator to power it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5328-helmsderp","name":"HelmsDerp","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"652"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-06T12:55:54-08:00","id":802284,"title":"","content":"I was under the impression that while Chambers were reflective of places in the real world, they change when they enter the Lair to reflect the theme of the thing. For example, if a Beast whose Horror was a creature of the desert made a house into a chamber, in the Lair it would rise from the sands like an ancient ruin. If a Makara whose Lair was underwater was to use the same house, it would be rooted on the seabed. etc","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/forum/core/<img class=\"bbcode-attachment js-need-data-att-update\" src=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=423\" data-tempid=\"temp_423_1523360155059_212\" />\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10397-ajf115","name":"ajf115","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10397_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2416"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-06T18:24:29-08:00","id":802519,"title":"","content":"Who needs the internet when you have access to the collective unconscious of the human race?<br /> <br /> Just saying, since the Astral is, generally speaking, a narratively active environment, you should be able to get whatever you want within your Lair. Whether it works perfectly is likely another story.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Crunch isn't a hobby; it's a calling.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1959-hexmeister-vic","name":"Hexmeister Vic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1959_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"764"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}